<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">- NKN66. USFM 15-06-2020 NT JUDE</book>
  <para style="h">YUNDA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda uakuhuminina kuli Yunda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yunda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yun</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda uakuhuminina kuli</para>
  <para style="mt1">YUNDA</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mukanda ua Yunda vautumbula Yunda muomu ikeye uausonekele. Yunda ahandeka nguendi ikeye munaina ua Yakomba, uje munaina ya Yesu. Kaha naua camoneka ngue napu umo ua munaina ya Yesu (cinimbu 1) Kutuazivukile indi ou mukanda vausonekelele ku cikungulukilo cimo kaha tumona nomu vanasonekelamo mu Litavasano Lialaja, vakakutanda vou mukanda ua Yunda vapande kupua Vayunda. Cipue ngoco, asonekela mukanda uendi “kuli voshe vanasana, vaje vazanga Njambi Tate na kuvatumbikila Yesu Kilistu” (cinimbu 1) Ou mukanda ca moneka ngue vausonekele hamiaka makumi atanu na likumi limo (60) hanima yakusemuka ca Yesu. Visinganieka viendi via sonekelele ou mukanda ku vaka Kilistu voshe atonda ngeci avanangule ku valongisi vamakuli vaje vatonda kuvazimbalesa (Yunda cinimbu 4) Ali na kusetekesa na vilinga via mu Litavasano Lialaja nankuma uahanene nzili ku vimpata viendi. Ou mukanda ulipangela na visinganieka viavingi na mukanda ua Petulu uamucivali kupandakana na kunangula ku valongisi va makuli (Yunda cinimbu 4, 2 Petulu 2:1) hamo na kusetekesa na tungelo na Sondoma na Ngomola.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Cakulivanga Yunda ahandeka kuli vakakutanda vendi (cinimbu 1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Cakuhatako, ali nakuvahana vika vije vianasonekela ou mukanda ha kuvanangula ku valongisi va makuli (cinimbu 3-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Hanima yevi avahana cimueso cakuhuma ku vantu na vintsimbu via mu Litavasano Lialaja (cinimbu 5-16)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ambahoni avaleka muvanapandele kukumbuluilamo ku vinangulo (cinimbu 17-23)</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Mukumanesa ashoka mukanda na kushangazala Njambi (cinimbu 24-25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Yange Yunda ngamba ya Yesu Kilistu, yange naua munaina ya Yakomba. Kuli vaje vacizango vanasana Njambi, vaje vayoya muli Njambi Tate na mukuniunga ca Yesu Kilistu.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Njambi amihane cikeketima na ciyulo na cizango museteko yakushula.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valongisi vamakuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Vamuanetu, njalingile munjaselelemo muoshe kumisonekela ha kuovoka cije citulinaco tuva voshe, omo njauanene nzili yakumisonekela ha kumisimpisa mukuluisa lutsilielo luje Njambi uahanene laja ku vantu vendi voshe. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Muomu vantu vamo vakakuhona kutsiliela vanakovela muvushueke hakati ketu, vantu vaje vakakutengulula kavumbi ka Njambi linga valisambuese vakevo vavenia ku mashungu avo amapi, kaha vanaviana Yesu Kilistu, Muene uetu. Kuntsenkulu visoneka viambuluile cihiso cije civanatambula.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Cipue vene muazivuka viuma vioshe evi, vuno honi njitonda kumianukisa muje vati Muene uovuele vantu Vaisaleli kuhuma mu cifuti ca Ingito, vuno honi munima yevi uanongesele vaje kuvatsilielele. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Vulukeni tungelo vaje kuvaniungile mihela yavo na nzili yavo yakama, vuno honi vasezele mihela yavo, vavakutile na malienge a yaye mu milima ya kuintsi, kuje Njambi alinakuvaniungila noho ha Litangua liakama lia cisompelo. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Vulukeni Sondoma na Ngomola, na vinganda vije viahateleko, vije vantu vamuo valingile ngue muje muvalingile vaje tungelo mukulikundika ku vilinga via vupangala na mashungu amapi, vakayanda kashitiko ka tuhia tua yaye linga cipue cimueso kuli voshe.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Mu ngila eyi vene, vantu ava naua vakala na vimona vije vika vatuamenena linga valinge vupi ku mivila yavo vavenia, vakayengula nzili ya Njambi yakama, kaha vakashaula vaka vumpau vaje vali helu. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Cipue uje kangelo ua mukuluntu Mingeli kacilingile eci mukulicokota cendi na Satana, omo valizungilile muvila ua Mosesa, Mingeli kalikuasesele kuhisa Satana na mezi akumushaula, vuno honi uahandekele kuli ikeye nguendi, “Muene akutenukile!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Vuno honi vantu ava vakaluisa na mezi akushaula viuma vije kuvazivuka, na viuma vije vivazivuka na mana avo, ngue tusitu vamu musenge, vikevio viuma vije vikavanongesa. <verse eid="JUD 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Cilivene, tuyando kuli vakevo! Muomu vana kavangeya ngila ya Kaine. Ha mulonga ua vimbongo vanalihana vakevo vavenia ku mulonga uje ualingile Mbalame. Vanatenguluka ngue muatengulukile Kola, muje muvanongesele ikeye mukemo vene muvana vanongesa na vakevo. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Ava vantu vakevo vanapu ngue vitsuntsuiso mu viuano vieni via cizango, omo valia neni kuakuhona shuamua. Vakaliniungu lika vakevo vavenia. Vanapu ngue mashelua akupekumuka lika na mpunzi aje kekuneha kalunga. Vanapu ngue miti ije kuyekuima vushuka cipue mu ntsimbu ya luinza, miti ije ivanatukula na mizi yayo cilivene inatsi. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Vanapu ngue mankimba a cisali, kaha vilinga viavo via shuamua vili na kusholoka ngue lifulu lia mema. Vanapu ngue vintanga ntanga viakuendangana ngoco, vantu ava Njambi navatulikila cihela mu milima ya kuzivala vuii muje vakakala ya yaye.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Inoke ikeye uapuile ua mucitanu na vavali kuvatekuilila va Andama, uje kuntsenkulu uambuluile vunanguizi hali vakevo nguendi, “Taleni! Muene akeja na makulukazi amengi a tungelo vendi vakulela <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />mukusompa vantu voshe, na kuhisa ha vilinga viavo via kushaula Njambi na mezi akupihia aje vakakuhona kuvuila Njambi liova vakalikuasesa hali ikeye,”<verse eid="JUD 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Vantu ava ntsimbu yoshe vapua vaka kununguta nakupaya vakuavo, vaka kavangeya mashungu avo a mapi, vaka kulipamba na kuhandeka mezi a kulihalesa kuli vakuavo linga vapange vizango viavo.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vinangulo na vilongesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Vuno honi yeni vamuanetu munapande kuvuluka vije vamilekele tunganda va Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu ha ntsimbu yakunima. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Vahandekele kuli yeni nguavo, “Omo matangua akumanusuila akeja, vantu vaje vaka mishendumuna vakasholoka, vaje vakakukavangeya mashungu aje katondo Njambi.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Ava vakevo vantu vaje vakakuneha mahangununo, vaje mashungu avo angoco akeo akavendesa, vakevo kuvesi na Cimbembesi ua Njambi. <verse eid="JUD 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Vuno honi yeni vavusamba vange yeni tualeleleniho kukolesa lutsilielo lueni luakulela. Lombeleni muli Cimbembesi Uakulela, <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />nakulitulika yeni vavenia mu cizango ca Njambi, omo mu vandamena Muene uetu Yesu Kilistu mu cikeketima linga amihane muono ua yaye.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mueseni cikeketima kuli vaje vali na mitima ivali ha lutsilielo, <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />ovoleni vakueni mukuva humisa ku tuhia, kaha kuvamo naua mueseni cikeketima cakulipandakana na liova, vuno honi zindeni vuzalo vuavo vuje vuli natutoma tua mashungu a mapi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lilombelo lia kushangazala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Kuli ikeye uje asa kuminiunga linga keti muue nakumineha ku mesho endi a vumpau kuakuhona kapayo, vuaheleleni cikuma. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Kuli Njambi umolika ikeye Muyoyesi uetu, kuhitila muli Yesu Kilistu Muene uetu, kukale vumpau, na vumuene, na nzili na nzili yakama, na kuyula, kuhuma kulaja nakuheta ku ntsimbu ino, na ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>